<title>USA: Footstar to buy back up to 10 pct of shares.</title>
<headline>Footstar to buy back up to 10 pct of shares.</headline>
<dateline>MAHWAH, N.J. 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Footstar Inc said Tuesday it had authorized a repurchase program for up to 10 percent of its outstanding stock, or about 3,050,000 shares.</p>
<p>The share are to be purchased from time to time in the open market during 1997.</p>
<p>As of May 3, Footstar operated 496 Footaction stores, which sell branded athletic footwear and apparel, and 2,553 Meldisco leased footwear departments.</p>
</text>
